e provisioning across Linux and Windows.\nProficient in test automation using Selenium WebDriver, Pytest, Unittest, and Robot Framework with Python, integrated into CI/CD pipelines using Jenkins and GitHub. Automated smoke, regression, and functional test cases, generated detailed reports, and performed data-driven testing with SQL/Excel.\nStrong collaboration with developers, DevOps, and QA teams to ensure software functionality, performance, reliability, and security, while troubleshooting and resolving defects efficiently.\n.\n\nProject 2 - Feb 2022 - June 2025\nEcommerce Books publishing\n\nTools & Technologies\nRobot Framework, Pytest, Selenium, Pycharm, Jenkins\n\n\nTeam Size\n6\n\nRole\nAutomation Engineer\n\nDescription \t\nConfigured Selenium WebDriver, Unittest, Pytest, Robot, pip tool and created selenium automation scripts in Python.\nAutomated smoke and functional test cases using Selenium WebDriver, Unittest/Pytest/Robot and Python (PyCharm IDE and\nRide IDE).\nInvolved in the continuous integration of the automation framework with Jenkins with Git/Github repository.\nGenerated test reports using robot framework report and log files and analyzed the results.\nPerformed data-driven testing using Excel files and SQL queries.\nDebugged and fixed the automation scripts for any errors or failures.\nCollaborated with developers and other testers to ensure the quality of the software\n.\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\nSkills\n\nManual Testing\n(5/5)\n\nStorage\n5/5)\n\nOS/Virtual\n(5/5)\n\nAutomation\n(4/5)\n\nHTML5 & CSS\n(4/5)\n\njQuery & JavaScript\n(3/5)\n\nPlaywright\n(3/5)\n\nClient Interaction \n(4/5)\n\nTeam Management\n(4/5)\n\n\n\n\nTools & Technologies\nSwagger, Postman, Jira and Visual Studio\n\nManagerial Experience\nProject Delivery Management\nDeveloping the Project Strategy and Plan as per SOW\nStakeholder Collaboration\nTeam Building\nCode Quality & Best Practices\nDomain\nEcommerce\nStorage\n\n\n\n\nLanguages\nEnglish\vHindi\n\n\n\n\n\n\n	{"location": "Banga