ckend Developer\n\nThis is a consent management website and it is taking consent from Health Care Professionals. HCPs can register in the application. And there are several roles in the application like representative, manager, admin. They can access HCPs. They can give consent on the behalf of HCPs. They manage the profile of HCPs. HCP can give consent as yes or no. HCPs profiles have addresses, communication medium(email, sms). HCPs give consent on documents. And documents are created by the admin. HCPs can upload proof documents to give consent. Multiple HCPs can be created at once through API.\n\nResponsibilities & Achievements:\nHandled UI and backend development with APIs and database.\n\n\nProject 2 - Sep 2019 - Apr 2022\n Tribe365\n\nTools & Technologies\nPHP, Laravel, HTML, CSS, Jquery, Javascript, Ajax, MySql, API Tester, Postman\n\nTeam Size\n3\n\nRole\nBackend Developer\n\nThis is an organizational behavior app where users can react to their sentiments and fill their personality type like questions. Users can give kudos to other employees as a token of appreciation.\nUsers can fill the team and organization related questions. According to the user's answers, the system will calculate the engagement score of the user. Engagement score will indicates that, How much the user is involved with the organization.\n\nResponsibilities & Achievements:\nHandled backend development with APIs and database.\n\n\nProject 3 - Jun 2020 - Jan 2021\nFreshersApp\n\nTools & Technologies\nPHP, Laravel, HTML, CSS, Jquery, Javascript, Ajax, MySql, API Tester, Postman\n\nTeam Size\n3\n\nRole\nBackend Developer\n\nThe client wants a social media app for post photos and videos.\nThe team was responsible for developing websites and APIs. They want a website for the admin panel. Admin can see all the users records, posts. Posts are shown to users within a particular region or area. Admin can set the region from the admin panel.\n\nResponsibilities & Achievements\nHandled backend development with APIs and database.\n\n\nSKILLS\nWebsite development with PHP/Laravel/Codeigniter\n(4/5)\n\nHTML, CSS, Jquery, Javascript, Ajax\n(4/5)\n\nCommunication Skills\n(4/5)\n\nAPI Development\n(4/5)\n\nVue.js\n(3/5)\n\nSQL\n(4/5)\n\nReactJS\n(3/5)\nTOOLS\nPHPStorm, Sublime, Postman, API Tester, JIRA, Github, Copilot, VS Code\nMANAGERIAL EXPERIENCE\nTime estimation\nSDLC Management\n\n\n\nLANGUAGES\nEnglish\nHindi\nProject 4 - Feb 2021 - Mar 2022\nHART\n\nTools & Technologies\nPHP, Laravel, HTML, CSS, Jquery, Javascript, Ajax, MySql\n\nTeam Size\n3\n\nRole\nBackend Developer\n\nThe client wants a website, where hunters can book their property for hunting. Hunters can select the animals and properties for hunting. There is one more role in this is the owner. Owners can register their properties for hunting. Hunter can select the property with date and book property. Client wants an admin panel too for managing all the things.\n\nResponsibilities & Achievements\nHandled website development and database.\n\n\nProject 5 - May 2020 - Dec 2020\nTribeRecruit\n\nTools & Technologies\nPHP, Laravel, HTML, CSS, Jquery, Javascript, Ajax, MySql\n\nTeam Size\n2\n\nRole\nWebsite development\n\nIt is a recruitment website. Recruiters send the invites to candidates through mail from the website. Users fill the form and apply for the position. Users have to fill some questions related to self personality. Then the system will generate a response according to the user's answers. System generates the user’s result and according to the result we see which organization will be suited for the user. \n\nResponsibilities & Achievements\nHandled website development and database.\n	{"location": "Bangalore", "work_type": "wfh", "availability": {"is_available": true, "hours_per_week": 24, "next_available_date": "2026-12-11"}, "certs": []}	2026-02-23 10:32:53.885899
