n\nIt's a data-collecting platform that gathers case data from the court. We receive non-OCR versions of PDFs, which we then OCR and scrape data from the documents for our clients.\n\nResponsibilities & Achievements\nHandled the Function of This Data Scraping Tool to Manage Data.\nUsed proper project task management with Jira.\nBuild Debug Python This application with PyCharm Studio.\nProvide estimation of tasks based on impact analysis.\n\n\nProject 4 - May 2023 - Aug 2023\nTemplateEase (Template Design Editor)\n\nTools & Technologies\nAngular 13, Typescript, Javascript, GIT, Jira, Bootstrap, HTML, CSS, Team Coordination, Client Coordination.\n\nTeam Size\n10\n\nRole\nUI Developer\n\nThis allows you to create a template using its built-in properties for invitation cards or another kind of template in which you can use multiple designing objects and multiple languages for each greeting.\n\nResponsibilities & Achievements\nHandling the Administration of This Content Management, Manage UI Development for Admin and User Interface also perform authorization for various types of user like Admin, Data, Document, User.\nUsed proper project task management with Jira.\nBuild Debug Angular This application with visual studio code.\nProvide estimation of tasks based on impact analysis.\n\n\nProject 5 - Feb 2022 - May 2023\nInternal Trading\n\nTools & Technologies\nAngular 11, Typescript, Javascript, NodeJs, GIT, Jira, Bootstrap, HTML, Jenkins, CSS, jQuery, Team Coordination, Client Coordination.\n\nTeam Size\n9\n\nRole\nUI Developer\n\nA platform which allows the trading of the capital instrument (Organization asset) and collates asset and trading information from various brokers.\nResponsibilities & Achievements\nHandled the Administration of This Trading Management, Manage UI Development for Admin and User Interface also perform authorization for various types of user like Admin, Data, Document, User.\nDeveloped and maintained backend services and API endpoints in Node.js to