ents\nHandled the Administration of This CMS, Like user access, authorizations, point management system for fantasy games .\nManual testing with the team for CMS and Admin panel.\nInvolved in the creation of required template-based pages with the help of This layouts and designs.\nBuild Debug This Angular application with visual studio code.\n\nProject 8 - Aug 2020 - Feb 2021\nSocial Media\n\nTools & Technologies\nAngularJS, Javascript, GIT, Bootstrap, HTML, CSS, jQuery.\n\nTeam Size\n7\n\nRole\nSoftware Developer\n\nThis is about limitless possibilities. This is about individualism. This is about connecting people of various backgrounds with the same interest. This is about expanding your mind and experience. This is about expressing yourself.\nResponsibilities & Achievements\nHandled the Administration of This CMS, Manage all types of content for application and manage user access and authorizations.\nBuild Debug This Angular application with visual studio code.\nProvide estimation of tasks based on impact analysis.\n\nProject 9 - June-2018 - Aug-2019\nHuman Resource\n\nTools & Technologies\nAngularJs, jQuery, JavaScript, HTML & CSS, Bootstrap, Jira, Git, MySQL, NodeJs\n\nTeam Size\n5\n\nRole\nSoftware Developer\n\nThis provides Human Resources consulting services for employers on a project or retainer basis. This provides all Human Resources Services according to Human Resources management and Company.\n\nResponsibilities & Achievements:\nHandled the Administration of This CMS, Like user access and authorizations\nInvolved in the creation of required template-based pages with the help of This layouts.\nBuild Debug This AngularJs application with visual studio code.\nProvide estimation of tasks based on impact analysis\nEDUCATION & TRAINING\n\n2018\nMaster of Computer Applications, RGPV Indore\nIPS Academy Indore\n\n2016\nBachelor of Computer Applications, RGPV Indore\nDaksh Academy Dhar\n\n2013\nHigher Secondary School Certificate, M.P. Board Dhar\n\n2010\nHigh S